OL,3,GNEWSAWarning made over fraudsters
OL,4,Atargeting TfL ticket machines
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo commuters say they narrowly avoided
OL,7,Flosing money after using a ticket
OL,8,Fmachine suspected to have been fitted
OL,9,Fwith a card skimming device at
OL,10,FPiccadilly Circus Tube station in
OL,11,Fcentral London.
OL,13,FFraudsters attempted to steal almost
OL,14,F#1,000 from them when they tried to top
OL,15,Fup their Oyster cards.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
