OL,3,GNEWSAWarning made over fraudsters
OL,4,Atargeting TfL ticket machines
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not known how many other victims
OL,7,Fwere targeted but British Transport
OL,8,FPolice (BTP) has made nine arrests in
OL,9,Fconnection with suspected card skimming
OL,10,Ftargeting card machines across the
OL,11,FTransport for London (TfL) network
OL,12,Fsince last December.
OL,14,FElliora said she nearly lost #700 but
OL,15,Fthe transaction was flagged as
OL,16,Fsuspicious and blocked by her credit
OL,17,Fcard company.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
